WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.500
<b>A RECAP OF OUR PREVIOUS EPISODE</b>

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.500
<b>WE WANT TO FUNDAMENTALLY</b>

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.500
<b>SOLVE THE PROBLEM OF MIKAN'S CURSE</b>

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.290
A recap of our previous episode.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.460
We want to fundamentally
solve the problem of Mikan's curse.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.040
What is this place?

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.250
Oh! I found something!

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:12.540
It's all soft and warm.

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:14.250
That's my right arm.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:18.630
The poor visibility is probably due to components
of the curse having integrated into Mikan's ether body.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.920
It's going to be difficult
to warp around based on intuition.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.170
For now, just take a look and see if you can find
any problematic areas with your eyes.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.080
Problematic areas?

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.420
Tummy-wummy.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:31.000
Are you feeling okay, Momo? You don't feel cold
exposing your stomach like this, right?

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.670
That potion was so disgusting I wanted to die,
but otherwise I'm fine.

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:34.380
But...

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:36.670
It's possible for the body to develop
a resistance to that dark side potion,

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:38.540
so it'll lose its effectiveness if you use it too often.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.210
You should try to save it for emergencies only.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.420
We can't afford to do this more than once.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:52.080
<b>Receipt</b>

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:52.080
<b>For Darkness Peach from the Ogulab</b>

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:52.080
<b>Total: 7,289,590 Yen</b>

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:46.460
Also, I went ahead and billed you
for all the ingredients I used aside from that gem!

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:47.500
Thanks a bunch!

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.500
This has to work, because I'm gonna be
in all sorts of trouble if we fail.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.080
I wonder what was inside of it?

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:55.250
Anyway, let's get moving. Which way should we go?

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.500
Leave it to me!

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:57.920
Orientation Staff!

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:01.210
<b>PLOP</b>

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:02.330
This is the way to go!

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:05.250
Are you sure? Is that really how we want to decide?

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.420
This is less stressful.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:07.790
Right. Well, let's go.

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:23.040
Doki doki wa kore kara!
The excitement has just begun!<b></b>

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:30.670
Kiseki okoru yokan
I have a feeling that a miracle will occur<b></b>

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:37.920
Henachoko sajikagen de ii desho iza susume!
A novice's skill is enough. Now, let's go!<b></b>

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:40.880
Ichika bachika yukeru donna basho datte
It's all or nothing. We can go anywhere<b></b>

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:45.630
Motto kikasete core no oto made
Let me hear more even the sound of the core<b></b>

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:50.420
Futari te o awasetara kowaku nai yo
If you and I put our hands together, there is nothing to fear<b></b>

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.920
Komatta toki ni wa
When I'm at a loss what to do,<b></b>

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:58.960
Omoidashite kimi ga iru tte koto
I'll remember that you are here for me<b></b>

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:06.500
Onaji sora futari de miagete
You and I look up at the same sky<b></b>

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:11.000
Waraiatte tsurai koto mo norikoechaou
We smile at each other and overcome hardship, too<b></b>

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:16.170
Dareka no tame ni ganbaru koto
Doing our best for someone<b></b>

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:18.790
Sore mo warukunai
Isn't bad, too<b></b>

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:23.330
Kyou mo tonari de
We are side by side again today<b></b>

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:30.580
Tokimeki wa kore kara!
The excitement has just begun<b></b>

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:42.830
<b>A RITUAL IN DARKNESS!</b>

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:42.830
<b>THE DEMON'S NEW ALLY!!</b>

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.380
Can you see anything, Momo?

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:43.000
Nothing at the moment.

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.670
Sounds like a good time for the Snack Staff!

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:47.540
The heck is that?!

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:49.960
I gotta stay focused, so I'll save these for later.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:51.790
I see something!

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:52.330
Huh?

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.040
There's a light up there.

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:55.670
I recognize it!

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:57.040
It's Mikan!

00:02:57.170 --> 00:02:58.210
Let's go to her!

00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:58.880
<b>YANK</b>

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:00.830
<b>KA                                                                        SNAP</b>

00:02:58.920 --> 00:02:59.960
Emergency stop!

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.130
Not again!

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:03.750
Curse you! Be more careful with my tail!

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.920
We shouldn't approach anything in here haphazardly.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:08.500
I taught you the other day, didn't I? Observation is key.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:09.830
Observation?

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.080
What is your first reaction to seeing that?

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.420
That Mikan is adorable.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.210
Wrong. And now you're dead.

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.670
Don't you see the thick and dark mist
enveloping Mikan's body?

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.000
I'm pretty sure that's the core of the power
that protects Mikan.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:23.000
Our first order of business should be to try
and communicate with it from this distance.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.500
CRISIS MANAGEMENT FORM!

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:37.540
<b>DEMONIC</b>

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:37.540
<b>DARK SIDE BUNS</b>

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:31.170
Excuse me. I want be your friend.

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:32.580
We are the world.

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:34.420
I have a box of treats.

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:35.960
Why did you decide to speak to it in English?!

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:37.540
Because it's originally from overseas!

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.290
I figured it would try to attack.

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:45.960
I'll buy you some time, so keep trying to convince it!

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:47.830
R-right! Oh, gosh...

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.540
Whoa! The treats disappeared!

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.460
U-um, so...

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.330
Hello there, Ugallu?

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:55.210
Mikan's stressed out because of you!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.960
Is there any chance that you
would be willing to leave her heart?

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:02.000
It's not working. This thing doesn't have
any sense of hearing or sight.

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:04.880
It must've dissolved into that state after losing its vessel.

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:05.960
Uh oh!

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:07.210
Shamiko, get back!

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:10.750
It detected your magic and it's attacking
on instinct because it doesn't recognize it!

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.250
Then I'll just break the whole thing apart!

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.790
Keep in mind it's like a parasite!

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:16.380
Since Mikan is the host, there's a good chance
you'll chip away at her magic, too!

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:18.750
That's not good...

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.500
You'll just have to make an opening to retreat.

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:24.540
I didn't have any trouble cleaning up that muck
when I was inside young Momo's dream...

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:29.330
It's a mythological spear that can be used
to create stuff by churning chaos!

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:32.130
Momo. I need you to buy some more time.

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:34.630
I'm gonna use a weapon
that can solidify that gooey mess.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:35.460
Huh?!

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:38.830
Overpowered Weapon: Amenonuhokoooo!

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:40.170
Amenonuhoko?!

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:43.250
The spear from the age of the gods
that was used to churn chaos and create a solid form!

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.460
She can do that?!

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.630
<b>BABAAAM!</b>

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:49.040
That is clearly a whisk!

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:51.170
THAT IS NOTHING MORE THAN A VERY BIG WHISK!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:53.000
And it's the first thing to mind when you think of mixing!

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:56.880
Now I just have to use it to solidify that mist!

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.460
Then we'll separate it from Mikan!

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:01.080
Are you sure?! Is it seriously gonna work
looking like that?!

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:04.420
It's the perfect gift for people surrounded
by too much chaos in their lives!

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.380
Amenonuhoko!

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.540
<b>AMENONUHOKO</b>

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.540
<b>(DEMONIC VERSION)</b>

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.130
Okay! It's stirring time!

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:07.040
<b>SWISH</b>

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:07.670
<b>SWISH</b>

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:08.380
<b>SWISH</b>

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:09.330
Let's get solid!

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.040
<b>SWISH</b>

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:09.670
<b>SWISH</b>

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.500
Sure, whatever. I don't care anymore.
Hiyaaaaaah!<b></b>

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:10.290
<b>SWISH</b>

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.000
<b>SWISH</b>

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:11.670
<b>SWISH</b>

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.040
Stir and mix!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:12.330
<b>SWISH</b>

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:13.040
<b>SWISH</b>

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.170
Wow! The mist has started coming together!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.540
And everything's getting brighter!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:18.460
<b>Stop</b>

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:18.290
Stop.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:20.960
Th-that did it...

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.630
Somehow I pulled it off.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.920
It's a lot smaller than before.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:25.670
It looks like a girl.

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:26.250
Wha...?

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.210
It just talked!

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:28.630
What a relief.

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:30.330
Time for a chat...

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:31.670
Are you okay, Shamiko?!

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:35.830
S-seems like I used up too much
of my magic power. Oops.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.210
Staaaare...

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.630
But forget me, focus on Mikan and that girl.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:41.290
Staaaare...

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:47.080
<b>Staaaare...</b>

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:42.750
You gotta... convince her...

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:44.830
Roger that. I'll do what I can.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:46.170
You just rest.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.540
Staaaare.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:50.460
<b>Staaaare...</b>

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:50.290
My verbal communication skills aren't the best...

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:53.960
If things don't work out,
can I communicate with punches instead?

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:55.630
AVOID THAT AT ALL COSTS!

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:56.170
Fine.

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:56.750
Ah... my head is spinning.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.290
So, are you Ugallu?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.210
I have shape. Why?

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:03.210
Who you girl?!

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:07.460
I am... here on behalf of Mikan Hinatsuki.
She wants me to negotiate.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:10.080
How should I handle this? What would Shamiko do?

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:12.920
Do you like candy? I just wanna talk.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.460
If that's okay, will you please sit down?

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:16.460
Gwah.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:19.960
Uh... am I correct in assuming that you just sat down?

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:20.630
Gwah.

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:22.210
That's weird.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.670
<b>MIKAN</b>

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.670
<b>Hey Mikasso! Are you feeling better?</b>

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.670
<b>Hang in there, you're capable of anything</b>

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.670
<b>Hello?</b>

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.670
<b>A LEFT ON READ</b>

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.670
<b>JET STREAM</b>

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:24.580
I still haven't gotten a reply from Mikan.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:28.000
Based on the address,
Mikan's place should be around here...

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:29.960
What's up with this paper?

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:32.000
And why's her door all busted?

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:32.830
<b>HINATSUKI</b>

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:32.830
Whatever.

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:35.290
Hello, pardon me!

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:37.790
<b>ABANDONED ROOM</b>

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:37.790
<b>WITH A HEAP OF CORPSES!</b>

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.290
What on Earth is this?!

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.580
<b>Oh</b>

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.580
<b>my</b>

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.580
<b>gosh!</b>

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.580
<b>Oh</b>

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:41.580
<b>my</b>

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:41.580
<b>gosh!</b>

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.920
Oh my gosh, oh my gosh!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.580
Is there a psycho killer on the loose?!

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:44.210
Shush! They're diving into dreams right now!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:45.290
Huh? What?

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:48.000
Meanwhile, back inside of Mikan's heart

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:48.170
<b>MEANWHILE, BACK INSIDE OF</b>

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:48.170
<b>MIKAN'S HEART</b>

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.080
Yummy.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:53.000
<b>TRASH</b>

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:50.630
Chomp, chomp.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.830
Well, I got her to the negotiation table.
Munch, munch. Slurp, slurp.<b></b>

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:54.250
Ugallu...

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:57.380
A magic familiar modeled after
the legendary beast of Mesopotamia.

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:00.750
How can I spin this to get her to leave here peacefully?

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:02.790
Those long claws...

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:07.210
<b>Those long claws.</b>

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:07.210
<b>Although their reach</b>

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:07.210
<b>  is shorter than a sword,</b>

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:07.210
<b>I can't ignore the possibility</b>

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:07.210
<b>of projectile attacks.</b>

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:06.420
although their reach is shorter than a sword,
I can't ignore the possibility of projectile attacks.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:11.580
Chomp, chomp. Munch, munch. Slurp, slurp.

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:09.130
I can't see any legs which makes it hard
to predict her moves.

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:11.710
<b>I can't see any legs</b>

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:11.710
<b>which makes it hard</b>

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:11.710
<b>to predict her moves.</b>

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:11.710
<b>And I really don't like</b>

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:11.710
<b>the fact Mikan</b>

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:11.710
<b>is within her range</b>

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:11.710
<b>of attack.</b>

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:11.580
And I really don't like the fact
that Mikan is within her range of attack.

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:15.460
Hey, Momo? Why does it sound like you're
analyzing the situation by expecting to fight her?

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:16.130
Huh?!

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.330
N-no! We're gonna talk it over like reasonable people!

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:20.960
I'm kinda worried this is gonna go badly.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:23.000
Do you want me to give you some advice?

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:23.580
<b>Phew...</b>

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.130
All right. Help me out here.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.540
Aren't you precious?

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:25.710
<b>PRECIOUS</b>

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:26.210
<b>PRECIOUS</b>

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:26.710
<b>PRECIOUS</b>

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:28.630
Then I'm expecting a boatload
of those free vessel tickets later!

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:27.210
<b>PRECIOUS</b>

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:27.710
<b>PRECIOUS</b>

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:28.210
<b>PRECIOUS</b>

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:28.710
<b>PRECIOUS</b>

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.540
Oh my gosh! Was it murder?! An accident?!

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:32.420
Shush! They're diving into drea-

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:32.420
Ms. Lilith?

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:34.580
Brrrzzt!

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.380
Ms. Lilith?!

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:37.630
Sorry, Momo! We've got company here!

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:39.460
You're on your own, girl! Over and out!

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:41.000
Huh?! What company?!

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:44.540
Oh this just great....

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:46.580
Feel great hostility from you!

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.000
<b>That witch...</b>

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:49.790
Oh, sorry about that.
Don't worry, that wasn't directed at you.

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:51.580
I can't believe I let myself feel relieved for a second.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:56.040
Anyway, her using Mikan as a hostage
makes this kind of difficult.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:59.000
And if Mikan wakes up, this whole thing goes kaput.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:00.920
I wish she would back away a little.

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:03.420
Snacks all gone. You have meat?

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.380
Huh? Meat?

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:07.000
Hey Shamiko. Do you have a Meat Staff or something?

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.790
<b>Wobble...</b>

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:08.710
I'll give it a try.

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.500
<b>SHAMIKO RAISED THE WHACHAMACALLIT ROD TO THE SKY!</b>

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:19.880
<b>HOWEVER, SHE DOESN'T HAVE ENOUGH MP!</b>

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:14.420
I'm sorry. I can't manage any meat right now...

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:17.460
Although I may be able to summon
a Porridge Staff or something.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:19.880
Uh, okay. Sorry. Just forget about it.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:22.330
Have no meat? Too bad...

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.920
Her physical form is starting to fall apart.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:27.080
I guess that means the effects
of Shamiko's rod aren't permanent.

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:28.670
I'll cut right to the chase.

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:31.330
Would you be able to evacuate from Mikan's heart ASAP?

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:35.380
You stop use big words! Talk with easy words I know!

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:40.170
You go, leave here now. Become free.

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:43.540
That is my only plea. Mikan gets lots of energy.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.460
We all go home and party.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:48.420
Momo... you're turning into a rapper.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.580
The easiest language to understand
in this world is violence.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.880
Don't you dare give up, darn it! Keep trying!

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:55.580
<b>FLOOP...</b>

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:59.710
It impossible for me leave. I only made to protect Mikan.

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:02.540
This my job! Reason I have form!

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:06.540
When I summoned, vessel very bad and got broke fast.

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:09.460
But inside here I no need body to protect Mikan.

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:12.080
I no go away! Don't care what form I take!

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:15.630
Okay, but how did you decide
who to protect Mikan from?

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:19.830
I no see outside! If Mikan heart feel bad, I attack all!

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:22.420
Mikan safe! I very good! I best at job!

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:23.710
No, you are definitely not!

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:27.830
The truth is that you have caused Mikan
a lot of trouble up until today.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.210
She struggled to keep her emotions under control

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.210
because you would attack people
around her if she didn't.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:34.330
Oh no... Mikan have trouble?

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:35.750
Yeah, a ton of it!

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:38.170
And while I'm at it, you've caused me
plenty of problems as well!

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:43.000
My sister made a special barrier for Mikan. It changed
the harsher effects of her curse to be something funny.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:45.540
I was forced to wear all those
humiliating cosplays over and over...

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:53.290
<b>SNAP</b>

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:49.330
And so, as a representative of those you've hurt,
I think it's only fair that I demand an apology!

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:53.080
Momo... you're just making things
more complicated. Save that for later.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:56.170
Huh? I actually fail job whole time?

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:57.750
I no good familiar?

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:00.420
It's clear to me that you had good intentions.

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:02.670
But the way you did your job was very bad.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:03.670
I see...

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.000
My job protect Mikan.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.750
Cause her problem not good.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.250
I disappear again soon.

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:10.380
<b>SCHLOOP...</b>

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.830
I leave here before that happen.

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.210
I'm glad we reached an understanding.

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:18.170
Gwah! I familiar! Love hearing praise!

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:19.790
First time I hear from person!

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:20.710
This is great.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:22.580
Things went better than I expected.

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:24.330
But...

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.170
Hold on!

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:29.330
You said that your job was the "reason you have form."

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:31.420
So what's going to happen when you leave here?

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:35.540
I lose my purpose.

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:38.000
Have no job. Have no vessel.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:40.420
Reason for existence nothing at all.

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:42.000
So I just vanish from world.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:42.790
Vanish?!

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:46.000
I familiar. Have no heart or soul.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.580
So I vanish. It normal.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:48.710
Wait, wait, wait!

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.040
We can't let things end like that!

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.750
Absolutely no vanishing!

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:55.500
You just said that you like being praised,
so don't try to tell us that you have no heart!

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.580
Who you, suddenly upset girl?

00:10:57.580 --> 00:10:58.210
A cane?

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:01.500
I was sleeping over there until a moment ago.
I'm a self-proclaimed Shadow Mistress!

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:03.460
And also, self-proclaimed boss of this town!

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.040
Not enough stamina...

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.330
Take it easy, Shamiko.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:10.330
Boss of town? This girl?

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:13.750
She have such skinny and weak tail, but she your boss?!

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:14.880
Shadow Mistress?!

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.960
Yep. She's more or less my boss.

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:17.630
Dizzy...

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.790
I agree with her, you vanishing is not an option.

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:22.130
Let's think about other options until we run out of time.

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:23.750
But... I...

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:28.830
I born keep Mikan safe. But only cause Mikan problems.

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:32.460
Mikan mad. Never forgive me for that.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:40.670
Gloom, gloom, gloom, gloom...

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:34.630
Ugallu!

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:37.000
It seems like you're starting to come undone really fast!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.750
It's because she lost any attachment she had
to her duty as a familiar.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:40.670
WHAAAAT?!

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:43.000
Strange... have no power...

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:57.080
<b>GLOOM</b>

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:57.080
<b>GLOOM</b>

00:11:41.420 --> 00:12:02.130
Gloom, gloom, gloom, gloom.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:43.880
Hang in there!

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:44.920
Don't give up!

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:47.080
You totally seem heartbroken!

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:48.880
How can you not have a heart?!

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:50.920
I leave before fall apart.

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:53.000
This place always feel nice.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.460
Spent long time here.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:57.080
Want you tell Mikan that I grateful.

00:11:57.420 --> 00:11:59.170
Sad I no see her.

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:02.130
Want hear Mikan praise me for work hard.

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:03.130
H-hold on!

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:04.420
You wait right there!

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:05.580
Mikan?!

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:07.000
I've been listening in on your conversation

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:14.790
<b>GLOOM</b>

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:14.790
<b>GLOOM</b>

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:14.790
<b>GLOOM</b>

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:14.790
<b>GLOOM</b>

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:14.790
<b>GLOOM</b>

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:14.790
<b>GLOOM</b>

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:10.170
and all I have to say is quit getting depressed
over how you assume I feel!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:18.830
Gloom, gloom, gloom, gloom...

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.330
Jeez, you sure hard to hold!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.080
Stop trying to disappear right now!

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:14.750
Bwagah?!

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.670
Enough of the doom and gloom! Quit it!

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.830
She's got her stuck in a full nelson...

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.960
Mikan? How are you awake?

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:26.250
At the moment, Mikan's only half-awake.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:28.500
You experienced something similar, remember?

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:31.250
We had a sudden guest show up on the outside.

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:34.630
I had them help out, so we could half-awaken Mikan.

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:36.790
Is this okay, Shamicen? Am I rocking her head enough?

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:37.210
<b>OKAY!</b>

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:37.210
Okay!

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:40.580
Now I finally have the chance to talk to you again.

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:43.540
Ugallu. As your master, I am officially ordering you.

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:46.130
Stop feeling bad for yourself and try again!

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:49.540
Try again? But I do bad job and fail.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.880
Mikan not mad?

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:52.920
To be perfectly honest, I am mad!

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:54.750
I had a really hard time because of you!

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.880
Which is exactly why I'm not going to let you
take the easy way out of this and disappear,

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:01.710
just because you feel bad for failing at your job!

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:06.750
Listen to me. I also failed big time, but my friends
in this town still accepted me for who I was.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:06.830
<b>HIP-HIP-HOORAY</b>

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:06.830
<b>FOR MY FRIENDS IN TOWN</b>

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:06.830
<b>HIP-HIP-HOORAY</b>

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:06.830
<b>FOR MY FRIENDS IN TOWN</b>

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:10.130
So don't give up. You're gonna make a new start, okay?

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:13.080
Okay. But what I do about pink girl?

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:15.630
She demand apology from me earlier.

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:18.920
She's a magical girl with a gracious
and forgiving heart, so just forget about that.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:19.750
Hey, hold on.

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:24.080
I understand. I try again.
Gracious.... grumble, grumble...<b></b>

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:25.460
That's the spirit!

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:27.130
But what I do now?

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:29.580
This form still disappear soon.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:32.460
It's gonna be hard for you to do anything from in here.

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:35.210
But there might be a job for you out in the real world.

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.670
Huh? What do you mean?

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:39.710
That we re-summon Ugallu into the real world properly.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.170
And then give her a new job to do.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:42.920
I call it...

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:45.210
The "Ugallu Gets Reemployed In Tama City" Project!

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:47.290
"Reemployed"?!

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:48.170
Reemployed!

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:52.500
I'm so tired! How long do I have to keep this up for?!

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.540
Don't give up, Anri! Hang in there!

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:57.630
I hope everybody's doing all right in their dreams!

00:13:58.460 --> 00:13:58.830
<b>GASP!!</b>

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.170
Whoa! She woke up!

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:01.500
Good morning, Shamiko!

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.790
Hey, Anri! It's a good thing you showed up!

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.130
You really helped us out!

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:08.830
While you're here, will you help us
prepare a ritual to summon a new life?

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:10.040
Sure, you can count on me!

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:10.290
<b>SNAP</b>

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:12.250
Yeah freakin' right! I dunno what you're talking about!

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:15.920
It sounds like you're trying to rope me into some
dangerous stuff! You better explain yourself first!

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:17.290
Oh, of course. I'm sorry.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:20.250
<b>THE PROJECT MEETING NOW BEGINS</b>

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.080
Dadadada-doo-doo.

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:20.080
Everybody start racking your brains!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.130
A magical familiar named Ugallu, huh?

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:26.040
The summoning ritual 10 years ago went poorly
and ended up creating a dysfunctional Ugallu,

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:28.040
which meant she was never able to stabilize in our world.

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:31.210
Think back to what Ugallu
was telling you earlier in the dreamscape.

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:36.630
When I summoned, magic circle too small and messy!
I no understand my orders!

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:39.250
Vessel also very bad and not work for me!

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:41.750
UGRAAAAWR!

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:40.960
But worst part of all...

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:44.960
<b>UGRAAAAWR!!</b>

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.330
offering of fried chicken not tasty

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:44.880
because very soggy and reek bad of lemon!

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:47.920
Oh jeez... I'm sorry about our family's tastebuds...

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:53.920
Offering is first step of contract! Gross taste mean no
have energy in stomach! I no like idea of lemon on meat!

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:59.170
To give you a rough explanation, familiars are a
cluster of magic power embedded with a simple program

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:01.080
that receive a physical body from their master.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:04.710
Creating one requires a fairly high
level of training and expertise,

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.880
but it seems the Hinatsuki family
was lacking in that department.

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:11.830
And because Mikan provided
high-quality magic as the master,

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:15.790
Ugallu became a far more powerful
and complex creation than any ordinary familiar.

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:18.580
So that means it was Mikan who raised Ugallu, huh?

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:20.210
That basically makes her a mommy!

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:20.790
Mommy!

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:22.630
Please no. Don't start calling me mommy.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:23.630
But still...

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:27.540
Thinking about it, I really want to save her.

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:31.580
I was under the impression that she was just
a malicious devil the whole time,

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:34.080
since my daddy said that
he'd summoned the wrong thing.

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:35.880
But that wasn't the case.

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:40.250
She tired hard to fulfill her duty,
despite being born in a strange way due to my family.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:45.250
So now, I want to bring her into the outside world
and provide her with a new reason to live.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:48.580
If we re-do the summoning ritual
by following the proper procedures,

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:50.830
then the current Ugallu can stabilize and exist out here.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:51.540
Hopefully.

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:53.920
Okay! I'll help out! I'm still sleepy, though!

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:57.880
Right now, Ugallu is hanging on to its existence
inside Mikan's heart through sheer willpower.

00:15:58.040 --> 00:15:59.540
We gotta finish everything tonight!

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.790
Uh, an all-nighter? Are we pulling an all-nighter?

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:09.080
<b>LET'S ALL PERFORM A ****  SUMMONING!</b>

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:04.790
For starters, we need someone to make
a list of all the necessary steps and materials.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.460
Who has the know-how to do that?

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:09.000
There's one person that immediately comes to mind.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:10.250
Hey, Ogura!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:11.380
Yes? You called?

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:12.000
Kachunk, zooop.

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:12.000
Huh?!

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.380
Let me get down real quick.
Shuffle, shuffle, shuffle.<b></b>

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:16.750
We're trying to make a life-sized vessel
that's of the highest possible quality.

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:18.460
What are the best ingredients for that?

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:21.000
Are you saying the budget is unlimited?!
Can I go into the billions?

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:21.580
Don't be stupid.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:22.920
I have so many questions.

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:25.290
Ah, sorry. We just kinda got used to it.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:27.460
This and that and something or another!

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:25.920
<b>BLAH</b>

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:25.920
<b>BLAH</b>

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:25.920
<b>BLAH BLAH</b>

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:26.540
<b>YADDA</b>

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:26.540
<b>YADDA</b>

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:27.170
<b>BLAH BLAH</b>

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:27.170
<b>BLAH</b>

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:27.170
<b>BLAH</b>

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:27.750
<b>YADDA</b>

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:27.750
<b>YADDA</b>

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:37.130
<b>UGALLU SUMMONING PLAN:</b>

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:37.130
<b>A GOOD-QUALITY VESSEL</b>

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:37.130
<b>AN EXACT MAGIC CIRCLE</b>

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:30.380
<b>SOMETHING DELICIOUS</b>

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:30.380
<b>INFUSED WITH MAGIC (OFFERING)</b>

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.290
I've finished putting together the plan to summon Ugallu!

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:32.460
That sure came together quickly!

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:37.130
It was already mostly finished based
on the notes that Chiyoda's big sister left behind.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:41.040
I think Ms. Sakura was probably getting ready
to do the exact same thing.

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:44.920
But it had been left on hold because she hadn't
figured out a way to solidify Ugallu's dissolved form.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:46.750
Oh yeah? I didn't realize that.

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:48.460
This about sums it up.

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:49.210
She just wrote it directly on the wall....

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:50.630
Hey, do you guys rent this place?
I can't make heads or tails of it...<b></b>

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:54.580
Please don't. Ugallu will disappear
if I have a break down now.

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:56.960
So, I do have one piece of bad news.

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:58.540
It's going to be impossible for us to gather

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:00.460
all the necessary supplies in time to finish tonight.

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.130
<b>IT'S IMPOSSIBLE</b>

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:01.130
Huh?

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.960
We can't make the food that we need to use
as an offering for the contract.

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:08.330
Proper contract etiquette requires treating the familiar
to a feast of food infused with high-grade magic.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:11.960
But finding a good chef who knows
how to prepare magical food like that

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.670
is hard because there are so few of them.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.710
A good chef who can do magic cooking...

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.210
They've gotta be a virtuoso!

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:20.420
I know somebody at my part-time job who could do it!

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:21.960
Huh? There's someone like that in this town?

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:25.170
Okay, but the other problem is we'd need
some grade-A meat to cook that magical food.

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:27.080
And the butcher shops are all closed by now...

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:29.080
Anri's family runs a meat shop!

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:29.670
Yay!

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:29.790
<b>YAY!</b>

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:30.920
Oh, that's true.

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:35.130
But hold on, one of the ingredients that we need
to make the vessel is the tail fur of a mythical beast!

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:38.290
The fur is infused with magic,
which is why it can be used for alchemy.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:41.210
Even if we ordered it online,
it would take more than a few days to get here.

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:43.000
What's a "mythical beast"?

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:45.630
It refers to legendary creatures
that are capable of understanding human speech.

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:47.000
Basically, demons who are animals.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.630
Well, Shamiko is friends with one of those.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:49.790
Huh? Seriously?

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:52.670
Yep, the boss at the café that I work at
is a demonic animal.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.170
That doesn't mean I'm evil, though!

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:55.580
That covers everything, right?

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:57.210
Now we can perform the ritual!

00:17:57.210 --> 00:18:01.040
One more thing. Another required ingredient
for the vessel that we're running short on

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:02.460
is "soil from a premium leyline".

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:05.920
I know that mountain you two climbed
the other day turned out to be a leyline, but...

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.960
I actually brought some soil
from that mountain back with me.

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:09.920
Huh? But why?

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:11.670
As a way to remember my first victory...

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.040
From when you took this picture.

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:18.330
<b>GOMORAH!</b>

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:13.670
Gomorah!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:15.500
You really are so fascinating, Shamiko!

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:17.460
I'm so glad I decided to stick around you!

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:18.330
Uh, thanks?

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:21.540
This will work! We can totally have the ritual tonight
with all of this stuff!

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:23.290
Let's hurry and get to work!

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:23.750
Right!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:26.170
The evening has deepened into night.

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:27.540
We had some awesome meat!

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:31.000
<b>CAFÉ</b>

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:31.000
<b>ASURA</b>

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:29.380
Magical food for a summoning ritual?

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:31.000
I'm sorry, I hate to bother you so late!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:33.130
No sweat, hun! I'd love to help ya!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:36.750
I want you to make a dish that a little demon
who is fond of meat would enjoy eating!

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:38.710
Goodness me, this is some fancy meat!

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:40.040
I can't wait to get cookin'!

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:42.000
GLISTEN AND GLEAM!

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:42.040
<b>GLISTEN AND GLEAM!</b>

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:43.500
Slice, slice, slice.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:42.420
<b>SLICE</b>

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:42.790
<b>SLICE</b>

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:43.170
<b>SLICE</b>

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:43.540
<b>SLICE</b>

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:43.790
<b>SLICE</b>

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:44.460
Pop!

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:44.540
<b>POP</b>

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:46.000
Grind, grind, grind.

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:46.290
<b>GRIND</b>

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:47.880
Smoosh, smoosh, smoosh, smoosh.

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:47.920
<b>SMOOSH</b>

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:47.920
<b>SMOOSH</b>

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:50.130
What a quirk of fate.

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:52.710
I'm happy to welcome the little greenhorn
comin' to join us....

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:56.420
So I'm gonna cook up the ultimate fried chicken
that's filled to the brim with love and care.

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:56.580
<b>WOOOOOOOOSH</b>

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:00.830
This has gotta be the best dish I've made in my life!

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:04.580
I've filled these babies with so much mighty magic
that a regular ol' joe would faint from eating 'em!

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.460
Now I'm starting to worry if this will be okay...

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.790
Alrighty, now we just need the goods from the bossman.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:10.170
Um, Lico, dear?

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.330
Care to explain what's about to happen to me?

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:16.000
Yuko said she needs an assload of fur straight
off your rump to help a friend of hers, boss!

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.420
Language, Lico. Let's try and keep this clean.

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:20.960
And you're aware I can pluck my own tail fur, right?

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:24.460
But your back is still all sore, ain't it?
You might just throw it out again.

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:25.500
Let me handle it.

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:28.130
Then try explaining why exactly I'm tied up like this!

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:29.500
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:29.500
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:30.420
That's easy.

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:30.130
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:30.710
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:34.540
I love you so much that I want to see
all the different faces you can make, boss.

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:31.330
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:31.330
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:31.960
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:31.960
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:32.540
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:32.540
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:33.210
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:33.210
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:33.830
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:33.830
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:34.420
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:34.420
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:37.330
We're gonna have a long talk
about those tendencies of yours, Lico.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:35.130
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:35.130
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:35.710
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:35.710
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:36.380
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:36.380
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:36.920
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:36.920
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:37.580
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:37.580
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:38.580
I can understand where she's coming from.

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:38.210
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:38.210
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:38.830
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:38.830
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:39.540
Yuko, dear?

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:39.330
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:39.330
<b>CLAMP...</b>

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:41.210
Lico, you better stop this!

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:42.540
Ugh! Lico!

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:50.040
Please enjoy the beautiful sight of these chrysanthemum
flowers while the boss is having his tail hair plucked out.

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:50.040
Ugh! Lico! Argh! Licooooo!

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:54.000
<b>MAGICAL FOOD & TAIL FUR OF A MYTHICAL BEAST</b>

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:52.040
Thank you so much!

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:54.000
Right back at you, that was fun!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:59.250
I got the food and tail fur that we need from the café!

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:00.210
It's very bright!

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:02.630
We're just about finished with making
the giant magic circle!

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:04.040
Huh? Already?!

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:06.710
Okay, Chiyoda. Please put on the finishing touches!

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:07.080
Right.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.170
I just need to run an eraser over it here, right?

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:09.670
Yep.

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:11.130
I'll be over here mixing the paints.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:11.710
Okay.

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:14.000
Wait. When did the Sports Day
Committee members get here?

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:16.880
Everybody came to help us out after
I sent them a message explaining the situation!

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:19.460
No tears yet, girl! Or that Ugallu thing is gonna vanish!

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:22.670
All of our friends are helping out! Even though it's so late!

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:23.710
I wanna sleep...

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:26.380
Mix that water into the vessel clay nice and slowly, okay?

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:28.540
Hey, Sis, who is this person?

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:29.460
Even Ryo?!

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:34.080
<b>MINAMINO</b>

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:34.080
<b>OCHIAI</b>

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:34.080
<b>NAGAYAMA</b>

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.330
The magic circle is ready!

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:32.960
Now we just need the vessel artisan!

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.080
It's all you!

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:35.330
Leave it to me!

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.460
But her legs were just a blur, so what should I do?

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:39.830
<b>THE FINE EYE OF THE VESSEL ARTISAN</b>

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:39.830
I'll tell you how to handle that part!

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:42.040
Okay. Something like this... and done.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.750
Does that mean we now
have everything we need to proceed?

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:45.790
Amazing!

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:47.920
We really did pull it off within just one night!

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:49.960
Shamiko, it's up to you to activate the magic circle.

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:51.330
Huh?! Me?!

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:54.580
Reborn Ugallu is a demon.
So using a weapon of darkness is best.

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:56.210
I can help by supplementing your magic power.

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:58.960
You and I are connected since I'm still your vassal.

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:01.500
The effect of the dark side potion
will last a little while longer.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:03.040
O-okay then.

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:05.210
CRISIS MANAGEMENT FORM!

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:10.170
OVERPOWERED WEAPOOOOON!

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:11.670
Wah! It's so heavy!

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:12.630
Let's do this, Shamiko!

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:13.290
R-right!

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:16.710
Okay, Ugallu! Come ooooon!

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.080
<b>FLASH</b>

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.080
<b>FLASH</b>

00:21:22.040 --> 00:21:22.920
Gwah?

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:25.170
We did it! It worked!

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:25.880
Yep.

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:28.580
I outside... have body...

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:29.880
Fried chicken was yummy!

00:21:29.880 --> 00:21:31.540
We didn't put any lemon juice on it.

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:33.750
New body feels very good!

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:36.460
So, what my new job going to be?

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:38.080
Well, we all talked it over.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:42.290
You've become such a complex being
that I don't think we can consider you a familiar anymore.

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:46.170
So listen, you're free to go find
whatever job that you want to do in this town.

00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:48.790
And that's going to be your new job!

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:52.040
Find new job is new job? Confusing!

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:53.920
Feels like I break down again!

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:56.500
Overcoming challenges like that is what it means to live!

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:58.960
What's the matter?

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:03.130
I do my best since you issue command.

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:04.540
Okay, I go now.

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:04.670
<b>BOW</b>

00:22:04.830 --> 00:22:07.380
What? Where are you going?!
You don't have a place to live!

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:11.170
Mikan upset with me. So I find place to live far away.

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:11.330
<b>PLOD</b>

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:11.330
<b>PLOD</b>

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:13.170
<b>STOP</b>

00:22:11.420 --> 00:22:13.170
You're still saying crazy stuff like that?!

00:22:13.380 --> 00:22:16.040
Listen, I order you to stay with me
until you find what you want to do!

00:22:16.170 --> 00:22:18.210
You've already been in my heart for 10 years now,

00:22:18.210 --> 00:22:21.040
so sticking around for another 10 or 20 years
makes no big difference at all!

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:23.210
Starting today, you are part of my family!

00:22:23.210 --> 00:22:24.500
You got that?! Are we clear?!

00:22:25.460 --> 00:22:26.830
Okay, got it.

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:30.290
And so, I have yet another new friend in town.

00:22:44.290 --> 00:22:46.880
Mata aeta ne drama nandatte? (howa howa)
We met again. It's drama?<b></b>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:49.880
Sugu (sugu!) oshie ni mo icchauzo (utou!)
I'll go tell someone at once<b></b>

00:22:50.040 --> 00:22:52.790
Kakyuuteki naruhaya de (saa!)
As soon as possible<b></b>

00:22:52.920 --> 00:22:55.420
Ara post mo "ohayou" nante (pikopiko)
Oh, even the post box says "Good morning"<b></b>

00:22:53.040 --> 00:22:55.170
Hi, Ugallu. You got a nice makeover!

00:22:55.170 --> 00:22:57.250
Mikan styled my hair for me! Boss!

00:22:55.420 --> 00:22:57.630
Mou shippo made saeteru (waa!)
Even my tail is sharp<b></b>

00:22:57.250 --> 00:22:58.500
Give me something to do!

00:22:57.630 --> 00:23:01.460
Hakusen o tondette itsu mentsudoeba
If our usual members gather and jump over the white lines<b></b>

00:22:58.500 --> 00:23:00.040
Please don't call me "Boss."

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:01.290
I was just being full of myself that day...

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:04.210
Kyou mo hajimatteku
Today will start, too<b></b>

00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:04.000
Mikan told me! You are Mikan's boss!

00:23:04.210 --> 00:23:06.750
You bring many people and save me!

00:23:04.380 --> 00:23:08.000
Totsuzen ni mystery
A sudden mystery<b></b>

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:09.290
Without you, many things not happen like they did!

00:23:08.130 --> 00:23:11.380
Kurakura mayou kedo
Makes me feel dizzy and at a loss<b></b>

00:23:09.290 --> 00:23:11.750
So you are boss! I approve!

00:23:11.630 --> 00:23:15.920
Te to te o tori doko made mo susume
But we will hold hands and go anywhere we want<b></b>

00:23:13.420 --> 00:23:16.000
But your tail is still weak and you look kinda small!

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:17.630
Darn it! "Small" is a banned word!

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:22.960
Guruguru machi wa mawari kagayaku
The city is turning and shining<b></b>

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:21.000
So, Boss.

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:21.540
<b>HMPH</b>

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:22.880
What's our next plan?

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:24.540
Cut it out, I know you're making fun of me.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:25.750
Korokoro toehatae shite
Around and around many times<b></b>

00:23:24.540 --> 00:23:25.540
No, I'm not.

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:28.460
Yume o mazeta yoikagen wa
The night mixed with dreams<b></b>

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:27.630
What are you doing?

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:28.830
<b>What are</b>

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:28.830
<b>you doing...?</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:28.750
I gatekeeper!

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:28.830
<b>I gatekeeper!</b>

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:31.330
Kimi ni hana o sakaseru yo
Will make you blossom<b></b>

00:23:28.830 --> 00:23:30.750
There's an example of someone who found their place

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:31.710
thanks to you, Shamiko.

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:34.330
Yomo made kakomu tetragon
The tetragon that surrounds four sides<b></b>

00:23:31.710 --> 00:23:33.540
I think that's proof your way of doing things works.

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:36.290
In hindsight, I realized I've done everything so off-the-cuff

00:23:34.330 --> 00:23:37.210
Aa machikado ni hanataba
Ah, a bouquet for our neighborhood<b></b>

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:38.040
that it makes my tail hair stand on end.

00:23:37.210 --> 00:23:40.170
Nee ima wa mou sukoshi
Hey, now, just a little bit more<b></b>

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:39.540
What's wrong with that?

00:23:39.540 --> 00:23:41.710
It's pretty similar to how my sister operated!

00:23:40.420 --> 00:23:44.210
Sottosotto sono hana o misete
Show me the flowers secretly<b></b>

00:23:43.670 --> 00:23:45.290
But you are kinda short.

00:23:44.420 --> 00:23:47.880
Yokubacchaeba mou ikkai
Once more if I get greedy!<b></b>

00:23:45.290 --> 00:23:47.420
I knew it, you are making fun of me!

00:23:47.630 --> 00:23:49.000
No, I'm not.

00:23:50.290 --> 00:23:51.750
Don't give up, Shamiko!

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:55.210
Keep working to create a town
that's easy for everybody to live in!
